@PaymentService_HostAddress = https://localhost:7200

### Procesar un pago (aprobado: amount < 100000)
POST {{PaymentService_HostAddress}}/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6", "amount": 45000 }

### Procesar un pago (rechazado: amount >= 100000)
POST {{PaymentService_HostAddress}}/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "7c9e6679-7425-40de-944b-e07fc1f90ae7", "amount": 150000 }

### Listar pagos
GET {{PaymentService_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Accept: application/json
